# Deploy SSH keypair (DigitalOcean). The PRIVATE half of this must never be
# committed — it is root access to the droplet. Generated locally, downloaded
# by the operator, and kept in GitHub Actions secrets. Both halves are ignored
# so a stray `git add -A` cannot pick either up.
